  "Twenty years later, Disney bought it for seven point four billion dollars.",
  "That's seven hundred and forty times what Jobs put in.",
  "Lesson. Before you sell something, ask what it could become. Would you have sold it?",
  "Follow for the next million dollar mistake."
 ],
